                "reply_count": 1087,
                "retweet_count": 4065,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "Our goal is not to decouple from China, but to open markets and restore balance.\n\nWe\u2019ll continue trading with China, especially in non-strategic goods, and at lower tariff levels.\n\nAt the same time, we\u2019re focused on reshoring critical industries like medicine, semiconductors, and steel to protect U.S. national security interests.",
