                "retweet_count": 3883,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Only in D.C. is a 20% hike to Medicaid over 10 years considered a 'cut'.\n\nMedicaid should focus on helping the vulnerable people it was designed for. Work requirements are broadly supported by the public and already implemented in many states.\n\nAble-bodied adults are not vulnerable.",
