                "retweet_count": 2532,
                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "The One Big Beautiful Bill will not close rural hospitals.\n\nIn fact, this legislation creates significant new bridge funding to help stabilize rural hospitals and enhance their long-term financial solvency.\n\nThrough OBBB, we are expanding rural hospital protections, providing targeted funds to rural care, and giving states flexibility to support local providers.",
