                "source": "Twitter Web Client",
                "text": "The shutdown was never about healthcare for Democrats\u2014it was about stopping President Trump\u2019s agenda at any cost. And they were willing to waste tens of billions of taxpayer dollars to do it.\n\nMeanwhile, the economy is thriving with 3.8% growth, and we\u2019re on track to accelerate even further into 2026.",
